## Upgrade the framework

When OneTerminal ships a new version, upgrade this workspace in place:

```sh
npx create-one-terminal upgrade
```

The upgrade wizard reads `oneTerminal.version` from `package.json`, fetches the migration manifest, snapshots affected files, and applies the migrations whose `appliesTo` matches your variant (`<%= variant %>` or `both`).

